source/reference_guide/time.rst:603: (regularisation) ["regularization", "regulations", "regulation", "singularization", "reregistration"] Diagonal regularisation of the pressure-correction Poisson operator, lifting its near-zero constant mode so a solver without null-space projection returns a bounded correction. Vanishes at convergence, so the steady solution is unbiased.
